<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Intl Paper raised at Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Intl Paper raised at Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its rating of International Paper Co on Wednesday to a long-term accumulate from a neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock was kept at near-term neutral, Merrill said.</p>
<p>-- IP shares closed at 41-5/8.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
